                                "sense_id": "2c76d21e-16bd-3088-ac7e-655b7f2b4a85",
                                "text": "The pressures of status give every individual a set of conflicting demands: imitate the group norms, counterimitate rivals, emulate superiors but not too obviously, and be unique but not too unique."
